Unit test ground
A training ground where one of every creature of the world stands still, grouped by allod: Gipat to the south-west, Ingos to the north-west, Suslanger to the north-east, Jigran to the south-east. Nothing attacks. The corridor between the plateaus leads out on all four sides.
